{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3847fad6-ef39-57c7-9461-86a349b2f256",
    "name": "HomeLift API",
    "description": "Every HomeLift endpoint. Pick the **HomeLift local** environment (baseUrl http://localhost:8080) or make your own for your server. Requests that create things save their ids into collection variables, so the folders run top to bottom. Errors come back as RFC 9457 problem+json.",
